# Architecture

Full map: [docs/PROJECT.md](../../docs/PROJECT.md).

## Layers

```txt
shared/             contracts + validation (client & server)
pages/              thin routes — compose only
features/<domain>/  study | words
app/                shell: layout, nav, routes
hooks/              cross-feature hooks (external sync only)
lib/                pure engines (no React) — tested with Vitest
api/                fetch client + endpoint helpers
store/              Zustand cache over the API
constants/          enums + named thresholds
types/              shared contracts
server/             Hono API + MongoDB (source of truth)
```

## Rules

- **No** cross-imports between pages or between features (share via `lib/`, `features/shared/`).
- UI components ≤ **200 lines**; pages only compose.
- TypeScript `strict`.
- Business logic in `lib/` or feature hooks — not long workflows inside JSX.
- English identifiers only.

## State boundaries

| Kind | Where |
|------|-------|
| Local UI | component `useState` |
| Words (server data) | `store/words-store` |
| Derived (filters, board) | compute in render / `lib/` |
